        </a></dd>

        
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A group of techniques developed to apply scientific methods and tools to solve the problems of <a href="/record/ui?ui=D003657" class="textLink_DECISIONMAKING">DECISION MAKING</a> in complex organizations and systems. Operations research searches for optimal solutions in situations of conflicting <a href="/record/ui?ui=D006040" class="textLink_GOALS">GOALS</a> and makes use of mathematical models from which solutions for actual problems may be derived. (From Psychiatric Dictionary, 6th ed)</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Operational Research
                    
                </dd>
                <dt>See Also</dt>
                
